# CLI uploads (vercel deploy): this file REPLACES .gitignore-based exclusion,
# so it must mirror .gitignore. Critically: .env must not ride an upload — the
# remote build must resolve the engine from the pinned github: tag, never a
# local ENGINE_PATH. raw/ is listed because it holds every upload from eight
# intake channels; unlike the sibling games the marker gate rejects only ~10%
# of it (seven of the eight channels are single-game), so raw/ here is large
# because the corpus is large, not because most of it is another game.
.env*
node_modules
raw
cache
secrets
.nuxt
.output
.vercel
.data
dist
public/data
